{"seq":7,"slug":"marine-science","title":"海洋科学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science","introMarkdown":"# 海洋科学 简介\n\n海洋科学（专业代码070701）是理学门类中以海洋为研究对象的综合性学科，旨在揭示海洋系统中物理、化学、生物和地质过程的基本规律，并为国家\"海洋强国\"战略提供科学支撑和人才储备。本知识库面向大学海洋科学专业本科生及相关方向研究生，系统梳理四大二级学科的核心知识体系。\n\n本知识库包含以下四个章节：\n\n第一章**物理海洋学**聚焦海水运动的物理机制，涵盖大洋环流动力学、波浪潮汐与海流、海—气相互作用三大主题。从风驱环流到热盐环流，从表面波到内波，从ENSO到气候变化，构建对海洋物理过程的系统认识。\n\n第二章**海洋生物与生态**围绕海洋生命系统展开，包括海洋生物多样性、海洋生态系统生态学、海洋生物技术三个方向。从浮游生物到深海极端生命，从食物网结构到生物地球化学循环，再到基因工程与活性物质开发，展现海洋生物学的广度与前沿。\n\n第三章**海洋地质与化学**探讨海底固体地球过程和海水化学体系，涉及海底地质学、海洋地球化学、海洋沉积学。从板块构造到热液系统，从碳循环到同位素示踪，从沉积物搬运到古海洋学记录，揭示地球-海洋协同演化的历史。\n\n第四章**海洋技术与应用**关注观测手段与数值方法的实践应用，包括海洋观测技术、卫星海洋遥感、海洋数值模拟与预测。从CTD和ADCP到Argo全球观测网，从卫星高度计到合成孔径雷达，从ROMS到数据同化，展现现代海洋学的技术驱动力。\n\n推荐学习路径：建议先修物理海洋学打下力学基础，再学习海洋地质与化学了解海洋环境背景，之后进入海洋生物与生态理解生命过程，最后通过海洋技术与应用掌握研究工具。学习过程中应结合Python/MATLAB数据处理实践和海上实习（如\"中山大学\"号科考船），将理论与观测紧密结合。\n\n厦门大学、中国海洋大学在本学科排名全国前列（A+），中山大学近年发展迅速。毕业生可在海洋局、气象局、自然资源部门、科研院所、海洋工程企业等领域从事科研、管理和技术开发工作，也可继续攻读物理海洋、海洋生物、海洋化学、海洋地质等方向的硕博学位。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-oceanography","title":"物理海洋学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/physical-oceanography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ocean-circulation-dynamics","title":"大洋环流动力学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/physical-oceanography/ocean-circulation-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"waves-tides-currents","title":"波浪潮汐与海流","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/physical-oceanography/waves-tides-currents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ocean-atmosphere-interaction","title":"海—气相互作用","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/physical-oceanography/ocean-atmosphere-interaction"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"marine-biology-ecology","title":"海洋生物与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"marine-biodiversity","title":"海洋生物多样性","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-biodiversity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marine-ecosystem-ecology","title":"海洋生态系统生态学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-ecosystem-ecology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-biotechnology","title":"海洋生物技术","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-biology-ecology/marine-biotechnology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-geology-chemistry","title":"海洋地质与化学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seafloor-geology","title":"海底地质学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/seafloor-geology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marine-geochemistry","title":"海洋地球化学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/marine-geochemistry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marine-sedimentology","title":"海洋沉积学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/marine-geology-chemistry/marine-sedimentology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ocean-technology-applications","title":"海洋技术与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/ocean-technology-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ocean-observation-technology","title":"海洋观测技术","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/ocean-technology-applications/ocean-observation-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ocean-remote-sensing","title":"卫星海洋遥感","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/ocean-technology-applications/ocean-remote-sensing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ocean-modeling-prediction","title":"海洋数值模拟与预测","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/marine-science/ocean-technology-applications/ocean-modeling-prediction"}]}]}